# Python RAG service
#
# The formatter arrived with the desktop client and should not retroactively
# rewrite files owned by the service. Two concrete reasons, not just etiquette:
#
#   data/    Demo input fixtures that the loader and chunker read directly, plus
#            data/demo_runs/<timestamp>/ output. Reflowing a fixture changes what
#            the chunker produces and can move an assertion out from under a test.
#
#   schemas/ JSON Schema contract files with live branches against them
#            (LCHAT-31, LCHAT-32). Reformatting them here only manufactures
#            conflicts for whoever merges next.
#
# Both can be brought under Prettier later as their own change, once the team
# agrees the service should share the client's formatter.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data
schemas
